The portable arithmetic adapter and fast/native paths were extracted from
https://github.com/doyaGu/ivp and https://github.com/doyaGu/VxMath.

The vendored Bochs numerical sources retain their original license notices:
third_party/softfloat/BOCHS-LICENSE
third_party/softfloat/BOCHS-COPYING
third_party/softfloat/cpu/softfloat3e/COPYING.txt

See third_party/softfloat/UPSTREAM.json for source provenance and hashes.

VxMath license text is retained in VXMATH-LICENSE.
